 "own_rule_reading": [
  "R1 calendar: house augur_engine.session_calendar.is_last_n_sessions_of_month(index, 3, day_id) (file LF sha = prereg pin); 217 flagged tradable sessions (73 months x 3 minus the 2 data-hole sessions 2013-11-28, 2014-12-31)",
  "R2 entry: LONG at the OPEN of the session's first bar in the data (bar 0); every entry checked = 09:30; one per session; no short",
  "R3 ATR(14): simple mean of TRUE RANGE (max(h-l, |h-prev close|, |l-prev close|), prev close = previous bar in the data) over the 14 bars immediately before bar 0 (= the prior session's last 14 bars); not Wilder; not high-low",
  "R4 stop: entry - stop_frac x ATR, live from bar 0 (entry bar) intrabar on the low; a LATER bar opening at/below the stop books its open (gap-through), else the stop price; stop checked on the last bar too",
  "R5 exit: the session's last bar's CLOSE (the last bar in the data for that day_id: 15:55 on full days, earlier on short days)",
  "stop_frac: NOT in the prereg text -> B frozen with stop_frac as a parameter and run blind at None/0.5..3.0 (armb_blind_prepass.json); the headline B uses 2.0, the plugin DEFAULT_PARAMS value, read only after the freeze",
  "costs: house 0.533 pt RT, real 0.7825 pt RT, stress 1.033 pt RT (house + 1 tick each side; not a scalper, reported anyway); $20/pt; booked on the exit session's ET date; zero days kept on the master's 1550 sessions"
 ],
